'''Misty''' (Japanese: '''カスミ''' ''Kasumi'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Choose 1 of your {{e|Water}} Pokémon, and flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, take a {{e|Water}} Energy from your Energy Zone and attach it to that Pokémon.
}}

