==Trivia==	
* {{TCG|Misty}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Misty]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in [[Kanto]]. The interior of the [[Cerulean Gym]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the regular print's illustration.

